---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Impact | Sport, Education, Nutrition | Velokhaya"
  description="Three integrated pillars define how Velokhaya develops athletes and students: Sport, Education, and Nutrition. Progress is rarely made alone."
  canonicalPath="/impact/"
>

        <header class="pt-40 pb-20 bg-brand-dark relative overflow-hidden" style="padding-top: 10rem;">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-brand-blue/5 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black mb-6">SPORT, EDUCATION, <span class="text-white">NUTRITION</span></h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-2xl border-l-4 border-brand-blue pl-6">
                    Three integrated pillars that define how Velokhaya develops athletes and students.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Moving Together -->
        <section class="py-16 bg-brand-black border-b border-white/5">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-white/5 rounded-full mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="users" class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-yellow mr-2"></i>
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-300">Moving Together</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Progress Is Rarely Made Alone</h2>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Training environments matter. Standards matter. Community matters.
                    <br><br>
                    Velokhaya is built around shared effort. Athletes train alongside peers, supported by coaches, educators, and systems that value consistency and accountability. Momentum is created through repetition, discipline, and collective focus, day after day.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Pillar 1: Sport (The Carrot) -->
        <section class="py-24 bg-brand-dark relative overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Background Accent -->
            <div
                class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-brand-yellow/5 via-transparent to-transparent">
            </div>

            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                            <div class="p-2 bg-brand-yellow/10 rounded-lg">
                                <i data-lucide="trophy" class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-yellow"></i>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-brand-yellow font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm">Pillar One</span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6">CYCLING PATHWAYS</h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                            Cycling is at the centre of Velokhaya's work. It provides challenge, competition, and a clear framework for growth. Our programmes offer structured pathways from early skill development through to elite competition.
                        </p>

                        <div class="space-y-8">
                            <div class="flex gap-4">
                                <div
                                    class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-brand-yellow/20">
                                    <span class="font-bold text-brand-yellow">01</span>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">BMX: Foundations of Skill</h4>
                                    <p class="text-gray-500">BMX is the entry point for younger riders. The technical demands of the track develop balance, bike handling, and confidence. <br><span
                                            class="text-brand-yellow text-sm mt-1 block">Highlight: Uyanda, Current BMX Development Rider</span></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex gap-4">
                                <div
                                    class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-brand-yellow/20">
                                    <span class="font-bold text-brand-yellow">02</span>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Road Cycling: Performance Pathway</h4>
                                    <p class="text-gray-500">For older athletes, road cycling focuses on endurance, race craft, and high volume training. <br><span
                                            class="text-brand-yellow text-sm mt-1 block">Highlight: Nicholas Dlamini, Olympian</span></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <div
                            class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-gray-800 relative group">
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent z-10"></div>
                            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 z-20 max-w-[65%]">
                                <p class="text-brand-yellow font-bold mb-1">Global Impact</p>
                                <p class="text-white text-sm opacity-80">Our riders compete on the world stage, proving
                                    that talent is universal, even if opportunity is not.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full h-full bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center">
                                <i data-lucide="bike" class="w-32 h-32 text-gray-800"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Floating Stat Card -->
                        <div
                            class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 bg-brand-yellow text-black p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-brand-yellow/20 max-w-xs hidden md:block">
                            <p class="text-3xl font-black mb-1">BMX</p>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold leading-tight">Developing the next generation of competitive riders through Velokhaya's programme</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Pillar 2: Education (The Purpose) -->
        <section class="py-24 bg-brand-black relative overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Background Accent -->
            <div
                class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-brand-blue/5 via-transparent to-transparent">
            </div>

            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
                    <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 relative">
                        <div
                            class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-gray-800 relative group">
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent z-10"></div>
                            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 z-20">
                                <p class="text-brand-blue font-bold mb-1">ICT & Life Skills Centre</p>
                                <p class="text-white text-sm opacity-80">Bridging the digital divide through
                                    technology access and structured learning.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full h-full bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center">
                                <i data-lucide="graduation-cap" class="w-32 h-32 text-gray-800"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Floating Stat Card -->
                        <div
                            class="absolute -top-6 -left-6 bg-brand-blue text-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-brand-blue/20 max-w-xs hidden md:block">
                            <p class="text-3xl font-black mb-1">HEAD COACH</p>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold leading-tight">Xolisa Makubalo — BMX Head Coach</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                            <div class="p-2 bg-brand-blue/10 rounded-lg">
                                <i data-lucide="book-open" class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-blue"></i>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-brand-blue font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm">Pillar Two</span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6">EDUCATION, WITH EXPECTATION</h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                            Education is a core part of life at Velokhaya. Training and learning sit side by side. Athletes are expected to engage fully at school and in the learning lab, supported by structured study time and academic mentorship. The same standards apply everywhere. Effort matters. Consistency matters.
                        </p>

                        <div class="space-y-6">
                            <div
                                class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-blue/50 transition-colors">
                                <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Academic Support</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Partnerships with organisations such as The Answer Series and Infinite Family provide study resources and mentorship.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-blue/50 transition-colors">
                                <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Highlight: Xolisa Makubalo</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Head BMX Coach with a degree in Sports Recreation and Exercise Science from UWC. Has coached multiple BMX teams to national victories.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Pillar 3: Nutrition (The Fuel) -->
        <section class="py-24 bg-brand-dark relative overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Background Accent -->
            <div
                class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_left,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-brand-red/5 via-transparent to-transparent">
            </div>

            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
                <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                        <div class="p-2 bg-brand-red/10 rounded-lg">
                            <i data-lucide="apple" class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-red"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-brand-red font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm">Pillar Three</span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6 text-white">NUTRITION AS PERFORMANCE</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        Nutrition supports training, recovery, and focus. It is part of how athletes perform and learn. Velokhaya provides regular, balanced meals as part of its daily programme, supporting consistent training and learning.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                    <div
                        class="bg-black/40 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-center hover:border-brand-red/30 transition-all relative">
                        <div
                            class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 bg-brand-red text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg">
                            Core Programme</div>
                        <i data-lucide="utensils" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-red mx-auto mb-4"></i>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Daily Meals</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Nutritious breakfast and lunch menus served every day to fuel
                            training and learning.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="bg-black/40 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-center hover:border-brand-red/30 transition-all">
                        <i data-lucide="heart-handshake" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-red mx-auto mb-4"></i>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Dignity First</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">We don't run a soup kitchen line. We provide a family dining
                            environment with proper crockery and cutlery to ensure dignity.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="bg-black/40 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-center hover:border-brand-red/30 transition-all">
                        <i data-lucide="users-2" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-red mx-auto mb-4"></i>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Community Powered</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Meals are prepared by community volunteers—mothers and
                            grandmothers—reinforcing local ownership.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Safe Cycling Advocacy -->
        <section class="py-24 bg-brand-black relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-[2rem] p-8 md:p-12 border border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
                    <!-- Decorative Background -->
                    <div
                        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-brand-yellow/10 to-transparent">
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                                <div class="p-2 bg-white/10 rounded-lg">
                                    <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-6 h-6 text-white"></i>
                                </div>
                                <span class="text-gray-300 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm">Advocacy</span>
                            </div>
                            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-6">ROAD SAFETY AND ADVOCACY</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
                                Velokhaya participates in road safety initiatives that support safer cycling environments for all road users. Through campaigns such as 'Look to Save Lives', we contribute to awareness.
                            </p>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                                <div
                                    class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-300 bg-black/30 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10">
                                    <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-yellow"></i>
                                    <span>1.5 metre safe passing awareness</span>
                                </div>
                                <div
                                    class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-300 bg-black/30 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10">
                                    <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-yellow"></i>
                                    <span>Anti-dooring education</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Impact Matrix / CTA -->
        <section class="py-24 bg-brand-black border-t border-white/10">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12">IMPACT, OVER TIME</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-16">
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-2">20+</div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Years of Operation</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-brand-yellow mb-2">Olympic</div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Representation (Nicholas Dlamini)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-brand-blue mb-2">#6</div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">World Ranking (BMX Programme)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-brand-red mb-2">3</div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Integrated Pillars</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div
                    class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blue/20 to-brand-red/20 rounded-3xl p-12 border border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-6">RIDE WITH VELOKHAYA</h2>
                        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                            Behind every strong programme is a group of people who believe in consistency, discipline, and long term development.
                        </p>
                        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
                            <a href="/support/"
                                class="bg-brand-red text-white hover:bg-brand-blue px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-bold transition-all transform hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-brand-red/20">
                                Support Our Mission
                            </a>
                            <a href="/contact/"
                                class="bg-white/10 text-white hover:bg-white/20 px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-bold transition-all backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10">
                                Partner With Us
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

</BaseLayout>
